  "slug": "batch-record-change-request-form",
  "title": "Batch Record Change Request Form",
  "subtitle": "Compare current and proposed batch record controls, assess affected work, predefine evidence, authorize a transition boundary, implement, and verify results.",
  "description": "A controlled batch record change request form for changing the batch execution and production record control without losing revision traceability, impact ownership, pre-implementation evidence, transition control, rollback readiness, post-change verification, or receiving handoff.",
  "use_case": "Use before altering the approved master instruction, formula or bill, routing, and batch procedure or its execution when the proposed state must be assessed, approved, introduced at a clear effective boundary, and verified before closeout.",
  "risk_tier": "A",
